                      "fill": "$fg-primary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": 520,
                      "content": "The archive was made over three winters with a single medium format body and a roll of black and white film per day. No light was added that was not already in the room. Every frame was printed dark, then lifted toward the surface until the image sat exactly at the edge of disappearance.",
